Here's a suggestion.  Have nurses run away in fear if you throw an
apple at them.  Especially if the apple has Alar.  Have them also
carry potions of healing, extrahealing, and cure sickness.  Have
grapes sometimes be poisonous.  Why not include different pets?
For example, allow characters to start with canaries.  A canary will
be able to sing, sometimes soothing a monster, and it will be affected
by gas traps that are adjacent to the character's position, thus
giving the character a warning; "Your canary falls asleep.  It looks
like it breathed something bad."
